### List books
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books

### Find existing
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books/1

### Missing book: 404
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books/999

### Create: 201 and Location
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"REST API Essentials","author":"Alex Brown","year":2024,"genre":"PROGRAMMING","available":true}

### Duplicate: 409 (run after POST)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"REST API Essentials","author":"Alex Brown","year":2024,"genre":"PROGRAMMING","available":true}

### Invalid request: 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"","author":"Alex Brown","year":2024,"genre":"PROGRAMMING"}

### Full update: 200
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Clean Code Updated","author":"Robert Martin","year":2008,"genre":"PROGRAMMING","available":true}

### Delete: 204, second call: 404
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/books/3

### VARIANT 4: Nested resource - 200 with two review DTOs
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books/1/reviews

### VARIANT 4: Existing book without reviews - 200 with []
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books/3/reviews

### VARIANT 4: Missing book - 404 with application/problem+json
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books/999/reviews
